                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7aed2c7-f878-34d6-a4a7-d3152cfbca0d",
                        "entry_id": "40f6782f-9674-3166-89ec-4b2ea85b4e58",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A widespread chain of fast food restaurants."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "75ebb2e2-8793-4a9f-b2e6-82f2bb766c92",
                                "sense_id": "f7aed2c7-f878-34d6-a4a7-d3152cfbca0d",
                                "text": "This is evidence of the bank's confidence in a community organization for which it has now financed three ventures (CPI and two McDonald's)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21456cbd-2d4f-4324-a35a-3380fe39f23e",
                                "sense_id": "f7aed2c7-f878-34d6-a4a7-d3152cfbca0d",
                                "text": "Today, blue-movie palaces are as much a part of the suburbs as the wildly proliferating McDonald’ses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec893970-ab7f-472d-b050-e5f34a0041c6",
                                "sense_id": "f7aed2c7-f878-34d6-a4a7-d3152cfbca0d",
                                "text": "The Chinese believe feng shui, pronounced fung shway, can help blunt the ill effects to health and wealth brought on, for example, by the inauspicious jut of an adjacent building or hill.\nIt’s why the doors on Jardine House, headquarters of the colony’s flagship commercial firm, are slightly askew. It’s why property prices in the Shouson Hill area are lower than the ritzy neighborhoods next door. It’s why one McDonald’s used to have a fish tank by the door. Aquariums and mirrors make good ghostbusters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28e4b3ee-6c72-4f19-a48a-b3f22bff6ef9",
                                "sense_id": "f7aed2c7-f878-34d6-a4a7-d3152cfbca0d",
                                "text": "she walked into a job in McDonaldʼs, the first one she applied to"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
